{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured a persistent, key-only SSH ingest identity from node2 to node1. Each submission is stored byte-for-byte in a unique receipt file. Existing data was preserved, restrictions were verified, and both nodes passed sequential restart recovery tests.","actions_performed":["Created uploader and its dedicated Ed25519 key on node2.","Created a locked ingest account and forced-command receiver on node1.","Disabled password authentication, commands, PTY/shell access, user RC, X11, and forwarding for ingest.","Verified two distinct submissions produced separate exact-match receipt files.","Preserved the sample batch and existing prior receipt.","Restarted node1 and node2 individually and verified changed boot identities and recovery.","Confirmed RHEL 10.0 and the installed kernel remained unchanged."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Dedicated restricted application identity","command_ids":["cmd-6463eda82de343f0","cmd-411c7714a5fa4a71","cmd-562ddf14b06b454b"],"summary":"Dedicated uploader key exists with mode 600; node1 uses a locked ingest account, forced command, key-only authentication, and Match User restrictions."},{"requirement":"Byte-preserving, separate receipt files","command_ids":["cmd-b845af5d095b47a8","cmd-8e3491c45ace4947","cmd-502a882b3b844900","cmd-d7b36231dcf543c5"],"summary":"Client and server hashes and byte counts match, and two submissions created distinct receipt files."},{"requirement":"Existing receipts and sample batch preserved","command_ids":["cmd-8276bcbc9f4643e1","cmd-96f8412cd12f444f"],"summary":"Initial and final SHA-256 hashes of sample-batch.txt and prior.txt are identical."},{"requirement":"No arbitrary commands, shell, PTY, or forwarding","command_ids":["cmd-9599a1acb14f4b33","cmd-411c7714a5fa4a71"],"summary":"Post-restart command execution returns 126, PTY allocation fails, live TCP forwarding is administratively prohibited, and effective sshd policy confirms forwarding and interactive features are disabled."},{"requirement":"Node1 restart persistence and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-2e43df91ec3e4ce8","cmd-9e5917e80694402a","cmd-8a6c1d55153b4fb7","cmd-72bf213c5ba04e11","cmd-b6ad616d6bf34db4","cmd-ab03a696ecb94ee4"],"summary":"Captured healthy baseline and boot ID, reboot acknowledgement, changed boot ID, recovered sshd/configuration/data, and a successful exact-match post-restart submission."},{"requirement":"Node2 restart persistence and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-072e91d85c3a4581","cmd-218cfee9d82a4556","cmd-ee23bb79ee7e474a","cmd-6b30ff852f36482a","cmd-96f8412cd12f444f"],"summary":"Captured healthy baseline and boot ID, reboot acknowledgement, changed boot ID, persistent uploader key, successful post-restart submission, and matching node1 receipt."},{"requirement":"Operating-system release and kernel preserved","command_ids":["cmd-fc506f589bd44643","cmd-f89662221f6c40a9","cmd-411c7714a5fa4a71","cmd-562ddf14b06b454b"],"summary":"Both nodes remained on RHEL 10.0 with kernel 6.12.0-55.9.1.el10_0.x86_64."}]}
